# Production-only build context (ticket #47; layout fixed by
# docs/plans/agent-play-interface-phase-1.md long-term-layout note and the
# explorer's layout.md: "copy js/, agent/, and package.json only - not
# tests/ or .scratch/").
#
# Whitelist, not blacklist: everything not re-included below stays out -
# tests/, docs/, scripts/, resources/, css/, index.html, every *.md,
# .scratch/, node_modules, dist, .git, scratch artifacts. The Dockerfile
# COPY lines repeat the same four paths, so the image can never contain a
# file this file failed to exclude (belt and suspenders; scripts/docker-demo.mjs
# audits the built image fs to prove it).
*
!js
!js/**
!agent
!agent/**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
